{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裸足のアンダー衣装( ^ω^ )\nピンクかわいい～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪飾りは控えめに小さいピン２つ。\n写ってない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台公演のMCで\n白米様の裏話をお話しして、\nみなさんに宿題を出しっぱなしに\nしたままなの思い出しました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白米様のMVにでてくる\n「第○話」の数字に\n意味があることをご存知ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくつか出てくるんですけど\n例えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第46話 は乃木坂46！\n第222話 はデビュー日&\n琴子蘭世(純奈ザキ絢音みりあ)の昇格した日！\n第827話 はまっちゅん誕生日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では第328話は？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生の合格日( *｀ω´)！\n二期生誕生日でございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この数字を知ってくれている\n伊藤監督はやはり\n二期生への思い入れが深い！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことをチェックしながら\n見直してみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がまっちゅんを手で飛ばして\nそれが蘭世にまで被害が及び\nむんって顔になってる(^o^)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、バースデーライブは\n白米様も披露する日があるので\nコール復習してみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/YOIZUWQoFO8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かりん」「ことこ」「らんぜ」の\nコールが難しいみたいで\n迷いながら叫んでるファンの皆さんが\nすごく可愛いなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と\n全国ツアー各地域で思っていました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モニターにコールの言葉出ると思うし\n気負いせずみなさんが\n楽しんでいただければなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白(石)米様ああ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティーの\nコールは簡単なので\nみなさん一緒に\nリンダ！って叫びましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aメロの\n「街の外れ国道沿い～♪」のあとの\nちまちまひなちまふーふー！\nも神宮で出来るようになっていたら\nすごく嬉しいなあ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/27/0871317/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨なんて吹き飛ばして3日間\n楽しみましょう( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}